---
import { TREATWELL_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE, TREATWELL_SOURCES } from '@/lib/seo/treatwellFacts';
---
<section id="treatwell-pricing" class="fresha-alt__section" aria-labelledby="treatwell-costs-title">
 <div class="container">
  <header class="fresha-alt__intro">
   <p class="fresha-alt__eyebrow">TREATWELL PRICING EXPLAINED</p>
   <h2 id="treatwell-costs-title" class="fresha-alt__h2">Treatwell UK commission, pricing and payment fees</h2>
   <p class="fresha-alt__lead">Treatwell is both a marketplace and salon management software. A commission for a new marketplace customer is different from fees for processing online payments. Repeat and direct bookings have a different commission model.</p>
   <p class="fresha-alt-costs__checked">Published UK terms checked {TREATWELL_FACTS_CHECKED_DATE} · <a href={TREATWELL_SOURCES[0].url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Treatwell UK pricing</a></p>
  </header>
  <ul class="fresha-alt-costs__grid">
   <li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">TREATWELL MARKETPLACE</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">35%</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">published first-appointment commission</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>Applies to qualifying first appointments from new clients acquired through Treatwell marketplace.</li><li>Not a universal percentage charged on every appointment.</li><li>Confirm eligible clients, VAT and contractual terms with Treatwell.</li></ul></li>
   <li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">DIRECT &amp; REPEAT BOOKINGS</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">0%</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">Treatwell marketplace commission</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>Treatwell advertises no marketplace commission on repeat clients.</li><li>Bookings made directly via the shop website/social integrations are commission-free.</li><li>Online prepayment processing remains a separate charge.</li></ul></li>
   <li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">ONLINE PREPAYMENTS</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">2.5%</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">+ VAT processing on published UK pricing</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>Published Treatwell processing fee for online prepayments.</li><li>Distinct from first-time marketplace client acquisition commission.</li><li>Actual plan pricing is subject to your contract; the site advertises “Start for free”.</li></ul></li>
   <li class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__item"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__kicker">FULL KERSIVO</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__figure">£39</p><p class="fresha-alt-costs__unit">per location / month</p><ul class="fresha-alt-costs__notes"><li>Starter also available at £0/month for up to four bookable barbers.</li><li>Full includes your own branded website and standard domain.</li><li>0% KERSIVO platform commission; Stripe processing fees apply.</li></ul></li>
  </ul>
  <div class="fresha-alt-card fresha-alt-costs__marketplace"><div class="fresha-alt-costs__marketplace-body"><h3 class="fresha-alt-costs__h3">New marketplace clients are different from direct bookings</h3><ul class="fresha-alt-list"><li>Treatwell’s marketplace can introduce customers your shop may not otherwise reach.</li><li>Its published acquisition commission applies to qualifying new marketplace appointments, not all future repeat visits.</li><li>KERSIVO does not include a consumer marketplace. It is built around your direct booking links and owned brand.</li><li>Under both KERSIVO plans, payments incur standard Stripe processing fees, but no KERSIVO commission.</li></ul></div><div class="fresha-alt-costs__marketplace-aside"><p class="fresha-alt-costs__example">Example: for an eligible £30 first marketplace service, a 35% commission equals £10.50 before any applicable VAT or other contractual adjustments. This is a marketplace acquisition fee, not a KERSIVO-equivalent processing charge.</p></div></div>
  <p class="fresha-alt-costs__note">Treatwell offers marketplace reach and broader salon management capabilities; individual plan offers and agreements may differ. <a href={TREATWELL_SOURCES[0].url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check published Treatwell pricing and confirm your quotation.</a></p>
 </div>
</section>